## 9. Add an AI settings page to the admin portal

The administrator should eventually be able to control:

| Setting              | Description                         |
| -------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| AI enabled           | Enable or disable AI responses      |
| AI provider          | Select the configured provider      |
| AI model             | Select an approved model            |
| Embedding model      | Select the indexing model           |
| Confidence threshold | Minimum retrieval score             |
| Maximum articles     | Maximum context articles per answer |
| Response language    | Automatic, English or Kiswahili     |

The settings API must validate the provider against an administrator-approved allowlist. It must not accept API keys from ordinary browser requests or return secret values to the frontend.

For now, keep provider credentials in environment variables and use the following configuration defaults:

```
CHATBOT_AI_ENABLED=false
CHATBOT_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.68
CHATBOT_MAX_CONTEXT_ARTICLES=5
```

Do not enable AI in production until embeddings have been generated for the approved knowledge base and retrieval has been evaluated.

## 10. Test the RAG system

Test with actual approved college content, not invented test answers.

| Test                                      | Expected result                                         |
| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| Exact question in knowledge base          | Relevant approved article retrieved                     |
| Same question phrased differently         | Semantic search finds the relevant article              |
| Question about fees absent from knowledge | Chatbot refuses to invent a fee                         |
| Question in Kiswahili                     | Response follows Kiswahili instructions where supported |
| Embedding provider unavailable            | Safe fallback response                                  |
| AI provider unavailable                   | Safe fallback response                                  |
| Model returns unknown article ID          | Unknown citation rejected                               |
| Visitor marks answer unhelpful            | Feedback saved                                          |
| Article archived                          | Article excluded from retrieval                         |
| Article edited                            | Its embedding is regenerated                            |

